@startuml sequence-srs-review-m23
title SEQ-06: Spaced Repetition (SRS) Review Flow (UC-06 / BF-12)
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "Learner" as Learner
boundary "Web Learner Client\n(SCR-L-10)" as Web
control "SRS Service\n(Route Handler / BFF)" as SRSSvc
database "PostgreSQL Database\n(RLS / PostgREST)" as DB
control "Supabase RPC\nrecord_review" as RPC
entity "ReviewLog Store\n(SRS History Log)" as RevLog

== 1. Query Due Vocabulary Cards ==
Learner -> Web: Open SRS Review Screen (SCR-L-10)
activate Web
Web -> SRSSvc: GET /api/srs/due-cards
activate SRSSvc
SRSSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM "user_vocab_srs"\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid() AND next_review_at <= now()\nORDER BY next_review_at ASC LIMIT 20 (illustrative batch limit, configurable)
activate DB
DB --> SRSSvc: Return list of due vocabulary cards
deactivate DB
SRSSvc --> Web: 200 OK { dueCards: [...] }
deactivate SRSSvc

== 2. Card Interaction & Review Submission ==
loop For each due card
    Web --> Learner: Display front of card (word prompt, audio)
    Learner -> Web: Flip card and indicate recall (isCorrect: true/false)
    Web -> SRSSvc: POST /api/srs/review {\n  srsCardId: card.id,\n  isCorrect: boolean\n}
    activate SRSSvc

    note right of SRSSvc
        Architectural Boundary (ADR-002 / ADR-014):
        - AI Server is EXCLUDED from authoritative SRS review persistence.
        - Scheduling uses deterministic Policy B [1, 3, 7, 14, 30] days.
        - Canonical locked RPC signature enforces atomic review recording and ownership.
    end note

    SRSSvc -> RPC: CALL record_review(\n  p_srs_card_id = srsCardId,\n  p_is_correct = isCorrect,\n  p_recall_probability = recallProb,\n  p_recommended_interval_days = recInterval\n)
    activate RPC

    RPC -> RPC: Verify caller ownership:\nauth.uid() = user_vocab_srs.user_id\n(Rejects unauthorized card access)

    alt Ownership Check Fails
        RPC --> SRSSvc: 403 Forbidden (SECURITY_UNAUTHORIZED_CARD_ACCESS)
        SRSSvc --> Web: 403 Forbidden
    else Ownership Verified
        RPC -> RPC: Calculate next interval via Policy B:\n- Correct: step interval [1 -> 3 -> 7 -> 14 -> 30 days]\n- Incorrect: RESET interval strictly to Stage 1 (1 day)\n- Compute next_review_at = now() + interval_days

        RPC -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        activate DB
        RPC -> RevLog: INSERT INTO "review_logs" (\n  id, srs_card_id, is_correct, interval_days, reviewed_at\n) [Canonical columns - No rating column]
        activate RevLog
        RevLog --> RPC: Log inserted
        deactivate RevLog

        RPC -> DB: UPDATE "user_vocab_srs" SET\n  interval_days = v_interval,\n  next_review_at = now() + interval,\n  last_reviewed_at = now(),\n  review_count = review_count + 1\nWHERE id = p_srs_card_id
        DB --> RPC: Card updated

        RPC -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        deactivate DB

        RPC --> SRSSvc: 200 OK {\n  status: "RECORDED",\n  nextReviewAt: calculatedDate,\n  intervalDays: newInterval\n}
        deactivate RPC

        SRSSvc --> Web: 200 OK { success: true, nextReviewAt }
        deactivate SRSSvc
        Web --> Learner: Animate card completion -> Advance to next due card
    end
end
deactivate Web

@enduml
